{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 刘海98种｜五行十元总索引 v1.1\n\n**完整研究卡：98/98｜参考图：98/98｜重复图：0**\n\n五行库由原研究Canvas重组生成，每项保留图片、来源、结构、正式十元、五大主题标签、视觉证据、误判边界和原研究链接。\n\n[[SKILL.md|五行S级Skill]]　[[00_五大主题与五行_广义狭义具象名词对照表.md|双系统对照表]]\n[[02_图片与结构审计报告.md|审计报告]]　[[03_图片资产策略.md|图片资产策略]]\n[[../00_研究建库冻结备份_2026-08-03/README.md|冻结副本]]","x":-850,"y":-900,"width":1700,"height":720,"color":"4"},{"id":"wood","type":"text","text":"## 木｜zx ↔ nx｜18项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3-long-blonde-hairstyle-with-beach-waves-and-bangs.jpg?resize=500%2C537&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/木/木_zx-nx.canvas|打开木库]]\n\n阳木zx：6｜阴木nx：12\n完整研究卡18张","x":-1900,"y":0,"width":700,"height":800,"color":"4"},{"id":"fire","type":"text","text":"## 火｜zn ↔ x｜19项\n\n![](https://therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10-curtain-bangs-for-curly-hair.jpg)\n\n[[五行库/火/火_zn-x.canvas|打开火库]]\n\n阳火zn：8｜阴火x：11\n完整研究卡19张","x":-950,"y":0,"width":700,"height":800,"color":"1"},{"id":"earth","type":"text","text":"## 土｜n ↔ x并z｜33项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/5-see-through-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=806%2C953&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/土/土_n-x并z.canvas|打开土库]]\n\n阳土n：21｜阴土x并z：12\n完整研究卡33张","x":0,"y":0,"width":700,"height":800,"color":"6"},{"id":"metal","type":"text","text":"## 金｜xn ↔ z｜18项\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/9847xSR6Q27uSbjVbFfvbQGJwJA%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/megan-664f89de405b4cd189a603b727900d26.jpg)\n\n[[五行库/金/金_xn-z.canvas|打开金库]]\n\n阳金xn：11｜阴金z：7\n完整研究卡18张","x":950,"y":0,"width":700,"height":800,"color":"5"},{"id":"water","type":"text","text":"## 水｜xz ↔ nz｜10项\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/4-wispy-korean-bangs-for-long-hair.jpg?resize=830%2C1032&ssl=1)\n\n[[五行库/水/水_xz-nz.canvas|打开水库]]\n\n阳水xz：9｜阴水nz：1\n完整研究卡10张","x":1900,"y":0,"width":700,"height":800,"color":"2"},{"id":"rules","type":"text","text":"## 当前正本口径\n\n1. 五行与五大主题是不同系统，分别记录。\n2. 每项按正式主十元唯一入一个五行阴阳端。\n3. 98项均保留完整研究字段，不是编号清单。\n4. 图片为外部研究引用，不冒充本地资产。\n5. 冻结目录包含17个实际文件副本。\n6. 自动重建器阻止冲突标记、漏项、缺图和文字版退化。","x":-900,"y":1050,"width":1800,"height":650,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e1","fromNode":"title","toNode":"wood"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"title","toNode":"fire"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"title","toNode":"earth"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"title","toNode":"metal"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"title","toNode":"water"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"earth","toNode":"rules"}],"metadata":{"version":"1.0-1.0","frontmatter":{}}}